{"code":"geocoach-plates","tips":[{"id":"geocoach-plates-1640","section":"Alabama","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=PTEsfrE1vu42UqAvHwnoqA&viewpoint=32.3689305491698%2C-86.26976354854358&heading=336.161506930721&pitch=-7.175158108727317","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: the yellow design in newer coverage (2021 on), the greener one in older coverage.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1640","temporallySensitive":true},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1641","section":"Alaska","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=cyFHOm1Juej5HYCUb7dJqg&viewpoint=61.219178795193656%2C-149.89556868782776&heading=317.3247928580624&pitch=-4.411019526743544","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: the yellow plate, by far the most common.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1641"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1642","section":"Arizona","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=x8RWVhvZvSWy8DulAW52yA&viewpoint=33.446929290319474%2C-112.0632173817169&heading=356.07259530024913&pitch=-20.052157040869275","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: the purple patch.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1642"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1643","section":"Arkansas","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=0ayBrJ780y7vWg0I11Vthw&viewpoint=35.27991117591319%2C-93.09410947691632&heading=319.6675170733547&pitch=-28.7394949545984","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: maroon text at the top center.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1643"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1644","section":"California","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=MrRdJH7eFAISARUmPv_DBA&viewpoint=33.85295663074988%2C-117.20694764949164&heading=195.3118412787723&pitch=-5.162507471595063","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: a bit of red at the top center. Often it just looks plain white.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1644"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1645","section":"Colorado","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=hqWiQuGkMwf0BWSM856tgw&viewpoint=39.59678032988111%2C-104.87962210589023&heading=248.68104703975132&pitch=-24.55464521746173","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: dark green at the top.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1645"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1646","section":"Connecticut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=hxcPISTdiywMLKW8mKki6A&viewpoint=41.734908033745654%2C-72.67924257927372&heading=48.28230737509318&pitch=-8.182451859978798","text":"Front license plate: required. Tip: looks like Illinois, Iowa and Minnesota plates, so check other clues.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1646"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1647","section":"Delaware","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=hQ36d9mCZYp8mCHIYS7i9g&viewpoint=38.76065542408754%2C-75.1457656285252&heading=245.38588171806276&pitch=-9.494409783476655","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: gold mixed with dark blue.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1647"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1648","section":"Florida","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=m91LEcojSS1cmwjZ_nM7Cw&viewpoint=26.60917816267187%2C-81.65172929909745&heading=142.7713197390461&pitch=-15.283305240596803","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: green around the orange in the middle. Tip: Georgia's plate is white around its peach.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1648"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1649","section":"Georgia","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=feRnXGoFs5o51t_eS3TNZg&viewpoint=32.03167616234799%2C-81.09223064067191&heading=274.26102375003194&pitch=-28.201070074241","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: a white plate with a peach in the middle. Tip: Florida's is green around the orange.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1649"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1650","section":"Hawaii","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=nrg9PkV2AXnFRo5buKxHKQ&viewpoint=21.342621386646577%2C-157.9028817523272&heading=259.2599804492768&pitch=-15.94158726734524","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: the rainbow arc, often visible through the blur.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1650"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1651","section":"Idaho","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=rppZS569twvraHktYIrO8A&viewpoint=43.49185910618657%2C-112.00471439195996&heading=360.2785169554549&pitch=-2.4018735687293","text":"Front license plate: required. Tip: think of it as the Paraguayan flag plate.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1651"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1652","section":"Illinois","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=ucQz5DERpmm62zmrbmq8Cg&viewpoint=40.69886411050896%2C-89.5931734470673&heading=11.77077670081065&pitch=-11.0880069339715","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: maroon text, which sets it apart from Connecticut and Iowa.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1652"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1653","section":"Indiana","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=YXYqC-ifQyhQjI_THYDtkg&viewpoint=39.77499367660423%2C-86.12996749030748&heading=11.803682972790178&pitch=-5.24989346742062","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: the \"In God We Trust\" plate with deep blue on the left. Not standard issue, but very common. Standard plate: light blue at the top, a bit of brown at the bottom center.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1653"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1654","section":"Iowa","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=hzrYJdeETSVeN7j5Hrqsyg&viewpoint=41.58686235453593%2C-93.80747076582966&heading=14.845012671401266&pitch=-11.076842719802457","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: faded green at the bottom of the standard plate. Tip: Maine's green is darker. The blue and white plates look like Illinois, Connecticut and Minnesota.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1654"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1655","section":"Kansas","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=7pGzNF1OePG_1vPVFOnxvQ&viewpoint=39.192428837544185%2C-96.5641241817311&heading=190.22018794771657&pitch=-3.262695426767934","text":"Front license plate: not required. Tip: looks like the old Rhode Island plate, but with the colors reversed.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1655"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1656","section":"Kentucky","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=-a84z2d6N6mhSCtfYBNlAQ&viewpoint=37.74435625814559%2C-84.27311078039043&heading=58.42837983736932&pitch=-11.800450178918284","text":"Front license plate: not required. Tip: looks like Michigan, but the blue part is bigger.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1656"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1657","section":"Louisiana","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=FuF8HJ2p-5Sm89ZsrsRYMg&viewpoint=29.974585229291204%2C-92.13132848587136&heading=3.3206122795603665&pitch=-22.300213071629543","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: a faded pinkish yellow bottom, maybe a bit of red at the top center. Often looks plain white; colors are clearer in older coverage.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1657","temporallySensitive":true},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1658","section":"Maine","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=EJKPRIZonhPdyUlY3H5OIQ&viewpoint=44.55238024284583%2C-69.6304425964704&heading=340.84876952608136&pitch=-16.282852474802908","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: very deep green. Tip: Iowa's green is lighter.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1658"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1659","section":"Maryland","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=rwcriUZAwMmzlIsCPJe6Fg&viewpoint=39.53829049769063%2C-76.34993069408779&heading=352.44699186223005&pitch=-13.013946261913048","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: the red brown part at the bottom center.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1659"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1660","section":"Massachusetts","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=DuQ9sHezMrw8x_-VLu6DCg&viewpoint=42.26865965778446%2C-71.80885670049375&heading=56.153311233465416&pitch=-13.96308448544852","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: red text, usually visible through the blur.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1660"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1661","section":"Michigan","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=BNWBtPGjldJaoo3VyZzr1A&viewpoint=42.74187594717793%2C-84.6310881939311&heading=261.6097830840979&pitch=-14.622102402077118","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: the yellow plate with a bridge. Rarer, but an instant Michigan. Tip: the white and blue plate looks like Kentucky, but Michigan's blue part is smaller.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1661"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1662","section":"Minnesota","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Md4tKwRY7Q1cPRDyzmuyqQ&viewpoint=44.00600823306706%2C-92.4691971200234&heading=267.9560083987104&pitch=-1.8152460274491349","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: a bit of blue at the bottom center (Iowa has none). The top blue part is smaller than on Illinois and Connecticut.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1662"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1663","section":"Mississippi","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=V9rfWQABK0QoKUT9tc42CA&viewpoint=32.32709770185887%2C-90.195184933676&heading=344.80590912255246&pitch=-12.511013230913846","text":"Front license plate: not required. Newer coverage (2024 on): plain white, sometimes a bit of dark blue. Older coverage (2019 to 2023): two big light brown patches split by white. Common in parking lots.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1663","temporallySensitive":true},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1664","section":"Missouri","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Rw2avC6PbW9zue6Z8H4q3A&viewpoint=37.14640992480395%2C-93.32132054376513&heading=31.66616891532712&pitch=-19.87332890221477","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: thin red and blue strips (red is easier to spot) and a colored sticker dead center.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1664"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1665","section":"Montana","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=pKDKbPqIU3xRodUoDIVGag&viewpoint=47.519531944847145%2C-111.31080750026965&heading=189.2309759546617&pitch=-19.161225300200684","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: the plain dark blue default plate, though it is rarer than defaults elsewhere. Tip: if every car has a different plate, it is probably Montana.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1665"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1666","section":"Nebraska","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=dP14js4gXfGxiHIg0c20oA&viewpoint=40.92041628134171%2C-98.352570239531&heading=13.89296444950854&pitch=-16.9045666771179","text":"Front license plate: required. First plate: white with a dark blue and yellow strip at the top. Can look like West Virginia. Newer coverage: looks white, sometimes with one or two dark blue spots in the middle.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1666","temporallySensitive":true},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1667","section":"Nevada","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=oQIlOREjPzLV0ww8L_m6Yw&viewpoint=36.09043563981663%2C-115.23555649086106&heading=55.26276448955082&pitch=-5.611574099088784","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: mostly blue with a yellow strip at the bottom.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1667"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1668","section":"New Hampshire","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=-gOG9QNeridHZRkPjD-BNg&viewpoint=42.98200408462724%2C-71.45013124956562&heading=242.51607624901524&pitch=-30.993961222881005","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: a patch of green on the right.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1668"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1669","section":"New Jersey","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=OLRDRTP0GbQJdAl7rg9kiw&viewpoint=39.47088858095059%2C-74.53138354263963&heading=288.2593617216869&pitch=-3.2076122028727383","text":"Front license plate: required. Tip: very common and easy to spot.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1669"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1670","section":"New Mexico","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=dKS8dFQrZQZ5ylbksVMKFw&viewpoint=35.24057085380307%2C-106.65524577818832&heading=196.77262961210147&pitch=-22.552622353284576","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: the yellow plate. The turquoise one is common too.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1670"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1671","section":"New York","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=vCnBuIi6L5yv0tChhTNPUA&viewpoint=43.03983550424338%2C-76.15999073414973&heading=235.0664499501617&pitch=-5.340892976225547","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: either design. Both show up about equally.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1671"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1672","section":"North Carolina","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=XcmgrvwxMNBDpwLj3NNXFA&viewpoint=35.79356032068399%2C-78.63612817937548&heading=304.8399647955528&pitch=-6.671702963261737","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: red text at the bottom and faint blue in the middle.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1672"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1673","section":"North Dakota","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=c7q7ipfit0lHfuw1T28HxA&viewpoint=48.11320141766065%2C-98.85909307270364&heading=320.7532810589491&pitch=-6.426549527819972","text":"Front license plate: required. Tip: brighter blue and an orange bottom strip set it apart from Nevada.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1673"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1674","section":"Ohio","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=mtqss_sFD9x_o5BKGx1pjA&viewpoint=40.11804545290795%2C-83.01411584422983&heading=334.236952215758&pitch=-13.016838480172908","text":"Front license plate: not required (since July 2020). Look for: the second design in older coverage.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1674","temporallySensitive":true},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1675","section":"Oklahoma","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Nef8YdrPFDixEYOfUeSsMQ&viewpoint=35.20414965721834%2C-97.46006020554312&heading=116.52425240614689&pitch=-14.998311021523191","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: light blue all around a white center.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1675"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1676","section":"Oregon","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=nEeVZcRhRX2f_UXNj-xtDA&viewpoint=44.890252549132654%2C-123.03263164517766&heading=333.28652144865254&pitch=-15.374619277213869","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: the tree, a big green oval.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1676"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1677","section":"Pennsylvania","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=aWoOuUXoIU467UeQsNxLWw&viewpoint=40.4381486254692%2C-79.76582628105507&heading=141.43628706606387&pitch=-19.41581946187864","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: blue, white and yellow from top to bottom.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1677"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1678","section":"Rhode Island","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=pYzIUcjA0unfaxjyfX4ZJA&viewpoint=41.77562998108406%2C-71.43464902671938&heading=314.9252200815191&pitch=-8.505592710089388","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: a faint blue wave pattern. Newer coverage (2023 on): the new plate can look all blue.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1678","temporallySensitive":true},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1679","section":"South Carolina","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=q6S0CmvPLdOO-MqLxcVK9A&viewpoint=34.01402026594777%2C-81.01044774634644&heading=256.0086554093808&pitch=-10.516967634195822","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: two blue strips split by a white middle. Tip: when the strips blur together it can look like Montana or Tennessee.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1679"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1680","section":"South Dakota","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=F6Kh6h_LoYCnjeILYjIy9g&viewpoint=44.07680431092674%2C-103.2084543581243&heading=267.75460636065003&pitch=-15.544553246959625","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: blue above brown or grey.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1680"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1681","section":"Tennessee","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=PCUH06QYgWI11Yi4gKXhMg&viewpoint=36.03256559400069%2C-83.93086329948046&heading=240.9381403742327&pitch=-5.606392895322472","text":"Front license plate: not required. Tip: looks like Montana's plate, but far more common.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1681"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1682","section":"Texas","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=7FtQ4oR0L9XRC6N04Eg0rw&viewpoint=30.30260667470534%2C-97.6988500642328&heading=275.67179895249353&pitch=-14.366940821628418","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: black text, sometimes. Often it looks plain white.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1682"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1683","section":"Utah","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=xJ7UsdSgspm0fMQZZU9m6g&viewpoint=40.62574982144021%2C-111.85067764564964&heading=206.0973734758448&pitch=1.950391769727588","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: the Arch plate, very common. The second plate shows up a fair amount too.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1683"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1684","section":"Vermont","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=CiKQMEJvN3hbTfAKThP0Fw&viewpoint=44.00222242120156%2C-73.15567227622034&heading=174.9323763263717&pitch=-3.873814845513252","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: a fully green plate.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1684"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1685","section":"Virginia","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=7W30M5d-obnCcsok5Ij7qA&viewpoint=37.53940290843517%2C-77.41455849667526&heading=284.2236122205844&pitch=-8.814140356099685","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: a plain white plate, maybe stickers in both top corners.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1685"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1686","section":"Washington","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Jq4m8GV6E3P7NauMwuBg2A&viewpoint=47.25391250168092%2C-122.4446776562538&heading=298.6851115536272&pitch=-16.603073391848625","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: very light blue, sometimes a bit of red text at the top left.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1686"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1687","section":"Washington, D.C.","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=4uNtHljTV-ssP-p7SEY_Rg&viewpoint=38.92293787947778%2C-76.99688782575997&heading=40.7205165446205&pitch=-7.394207924283521","text":"Front license plate: required. Tip: hard to spot, often looks plain white.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1687"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1688","section":"West Virginia","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=PxjxcyazBg2XKrQturRuVg&viewpoint=37.77392521695094%2C-81.19264192880696&heading=-1.2038547642071724&pitch=-4.950586724792075","text":"Front license plate: not required. Look for: faint yellow at the bottom and a sticker in a bottom corner. Tip: Nebraska looks similar, but its sticker is at the top right.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1688"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1689","section":"Wisconsin","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=-BUwaLXHcT1cY42WRlHJaw&viewpoint=44.522712794457426%2C-88.06358151030584&heading=345.9542994042769&pitch=-12.106486471133977","text":"Front license plate: required. Look for: red text at the top left.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1689"},{"id":"geocoach-plates-1690","section":"Wyoming","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=AuxO2YsV_u85ZBjCubz9xw&viewpoint=44.33977969415007%2C-106.70074225966049&heading=23.719683798903738&pitch=-7.522733121954687","text":"Front license plate: required. Tip: little Street View coverage, but the plate is easy to spot.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"1690","temporallySensitive":true}]}